62#rd","description":"AI让漏洞挖掘和攻击迭代不断提速，防守侧的落地为什么仍然缓慢？瓶颈在模型能力，还是验证、发布与基础设施？传统防御体系如何与AI结合，缩短从发现漏洞到线上保护生效的时间？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FarjmNWXmn5Ww0GqHjKT4dAc1oHCHfsic3hzBTBVh38JoPrSMJNrlQgib53feClTxvy8kL8tZibSk4wNicIicKBfMyNqM0W3gxXJpnYic2IjHhtbGw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-26T00:15:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485359:1","title":"eCaptureQ 新版，让 Android 抓到的明文更好读","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485359&idx=1&sn=31032ac0690ae08475eb563344f16464&chksm=f8acfff9e4cb813f4448a8e80db3a52c55cb59d012f0152bb442c87e86cf2fa8e153b66fc5f0&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"本文通过图文步骤，介绍如何连接 eCapture、按进程筛选流量、查看 HTTP 请求与响应，并结合接口报错案例，演示从发现问题到验证修复的过程。同时展示进程归属、TLS 参数和指纹等信息，介绍桌面版、Web 版及 AI 辅助排障的使用思路，附Demo，方便上手体验。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FarjmNWXmn5UiadB0PGd6Z3KgJXxgr1AQQBwvWSbz8k51D0RwFGib7l9wuSkWFOIkZ26yVNd9vXNxjRHIKLlgM1f0jDuXia3r3BGnXhgcw6IZ7s%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-16T00:11:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485334:1","title":"旁观者eCapture：支持龙芯，text 模式看完整 HTTP","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485334&idx=1&sn=b13a8137dbc24011df2e62409932dc3c&chksm=f87703f324691d94d7e2ae8acd1966094ab3fa819f85159b67dae23a4821a8c4cb7dbd4bf268&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"eCapture 新版支持龙芯架构，text 模式新增 pcapng 数据源，借助 eCapture Decryptor 实时解密、重组完整 HTTP 消息，让 HTTPS 排查更直观，并修复丢包、配置重载及 Android 打包问题。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FarjmNWXmn5VBhgPwozjbfXsiaRkG7YRYqUaPXD0NGR3dndnKxHWj7FCn8Hnlr7xw412BGuJ3erHIvWKVU10MDZWicvm1Mvo3GL2ib2YDeickxhQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-02T01:05:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485326:1","title":"轻装上阵 · 智能进化：PacketScope协议栈分析V2上线","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485326&idx=1&sn=13ca110376be5888c75b577f1ac98392&chksm=f820c9f333f4b58750c4e1ed6e122df582d09ccc846ce6e1ae4e7d775c72f86fe9330138b3b5&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"PacketScope 新版升级：一是底层从 Python+BCC 切换到 Go+bpf2go，不装LLVM、BCC，Docker秒级拉起全套 eBPF 协议栈观测能力；二是AI化支持Skills接入智能体，用中文就能驱动数据包追踪、路由分析、安全规则下发，实现\"自然语言→协议栈操作\"的完整闭环。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FarjmNWXmn5X1j4nhcl6kzAg9IHEgTkcvmEcu0Tg2dZ0EDPNgl7xZsYSNDQEZqDicLhOhWQNFuvtRTG0facO9GJr6HZyB2lHgffYP9YMyEJKM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-06-15T00:08:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485315:1","title":"eCapture V2 来了，AI Agent 是主要重构者","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485315&idx=1&sn=1cf48f76d4b738658f0d2276cc1815c0&chksm=f8f6a5e8405caa1e5d5561a202c53428402b77ef369edc0498635a4f34b9f71cf74f09dc4a62&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"eCapture v2完成了整个内部架构重建——8 个 Probe 全部标准化重写，E2E 测试覆盖 72+ 场景。更值得一说的是：v2 系列 90% 的代码由 GitHub Copilot AI Agent 完成，笔者主要负责写需求和审 PR。这是一次 AI 真正深度参与开源项目的真实实验。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FarjmNWXmn5VP9tnUzmo3ZicGRSvJVGmMZRl3IRN6RXEeuE9AyDfYicvAMfycgtl3icichsicOTP1usVGw29Y5NRm0ZNDMJDcUbKtAc2sxJfo2C8Q%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-04-06T15:42:43.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485306:1","title":"Android Binder 拦截实战：从源码调试到对抗分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485306&idx=1&sn=7a12b2b36e6ec824cfa636b943d8ba80&chksm=f8671ee2025dab10ae0dff76b7f48fc4889c4b747f9f5c4d7d7dcb94ea7e0c9d7023c53a9c9c&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"当应用层的 Hook 工具（如 Xposed）在日益激烈的对抗中逐渐显露疲态，你是否渴望掌握一种更底层、更隐蔽的“上帝视角”？本文将带你深入 Android 的血管——Binder 机制，演示如何从 Java 层一路追踪到 Native 层","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FIjnZ9ic9bGHtpj487Yc7fic8E4FUy4EgnibwoZ9EOv3nuBeGUPTE1GVaj8PkEWKW0ZYdgEphiczVbED0P2HkQM5Tqw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-14T00:36:46.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485256:1","title":"某APP样本安全检测绕过：小试SVC系统调用HOOK","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485256&idx=1&sn=a2b5b2da64e5daacde633a2ddcca1009&chksm=f8d9888962db48e24e9ec40d86aa92b6b2c87fd645711d2e2ea465029924ee404d84096a47d8&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"以某 iOS APP 为例，介绍安全检测绕过：C 层 Hook 无效后下探到 ARM64 SVC 系统调用，定位 syscall 层对 /usr/sbin/frida-server 的检测并通过 Hook 伪造参数绕过；再 Hook UIAlertView 屏蔽越狱弹窗，并简述 XOR 字符串混淆分析。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FIjnZ9ic9bGHuUKrBjYC9zHLbica2VQbRYcicWyImEzrmDoQGCB1fIFib5CfagsMUJlG7yzbZlLwIXQ0kDjLtRxYNiag%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-07T00:08:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485234:1","title":"eCapture v1.5：支持远程配置更新与事件转发，eCaptureQ 迎来 SQL 过滤【文末招聘】","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485234&idx=1&sn=39c8b7a33481026659abe18b855284ff&chksm=f8868e598e12d3aa8882a4519eac579512abc926ffa6767d579eb94f6abb6234fb652dfb43d3&scene=126&sessionid=1795678962#rd","description":"eCapture 迎来了v1.5版本。这次更新不仅修复了多个关键 BUG，更带来了两个重量级的新特性：事件转发 API和远程配置更新 API。与此同时，可视化伴侣eCaptureQ也同步发布了新版，为用户提供了更强大的数据筛选能力。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FIjnZ9ic9bGHsd9g8Fsnbbt2L1aJJq1mg2QV1Muoicpb46p6eYFItVfLBlBLljXnxSyA2tDnzVnibJQkHd1ryZSKzA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2025-12-08T00:20:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMDM0OTY5NA%3D%3D:2247485216:1","title":"从“识别难”到“自动拦”：如何用LLM+eBPF实现栈内零延迟防御","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDM0OTY5NA==&mid=2247485216&idx=1&sn=b4337ab44edfe8993d84bd2a5017bef6&chksm=f8c95f3b64fbac26f0f3a84268e17998fd